{'symbol': 'ABT', 'date': '2021-04-08 09:00:00', 'title': 'ABBOTT RECEIVES CE MARK APPROVAL FOR NEXT-GENERATION TRICLIP™ DEVICE, OFFERING NEW INNOVATIONS FOR TRICUSPID HEART VALVE REPAIR', 'text': 'ABBOTT PARK, ILL., APRIL 8, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0ABBOTT (NYSE: ABT) TODAY ANNOUNCED IT HAS RECEIVED CE MARK FOR ITS NEXT-GENERATION TRICLIP™ TRANSCATHETER TRICUSPID VALVE REPAIR SYSTEM, THE FIRST-OF-ITS-KIND MINIMALLY INVASIVE TRICUSPID HEART VALVE REPAIR DEVICE AVAILABLE IN EUROPE TO TREAT TRICUSPID REGURGITATION (TR).'}